      "number": 4,
      "pali": "“Nāhaṁ, bhikkhave, aññaṁ ekadhammampi samanupassāmi yo evaṁ mahato anatthāya saṁvattati yathayidaṁ, bhikkhave, pamādo. ",
      "english": "“Mendicants, I do not see a single thing that is so very harmful as negligence. "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "Pamādo, bhikkhave, mahato anatthāya saṁvattatī”ti. ",
      "english": "Negligence is very harmful.” "
